5160214102016475"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-27T18:46:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115153124361171058"], "id": "2115153124361171058", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1294, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114922564527206570", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "yeah but neolocality and weakened kinship were not actually that important parts of why Europe got rich nor why, extremely suddenly in the 19th and 20th centuries, representative democracy won the upper hand\n\nit's just a made up story https://t.co/TKRqoe9SbY", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2115153124361171058"}, {"author_id": "46648807", "created_at": "2026-10-27T18:45:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115152818864529861"], "id": "2115152818864529861", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 908, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "NIST’s new PQC migration guidelines can help organizations transition to post-quantum cryptography standards. This report outlines the timelines and activities for federal agencies and serves as a resource for organizations navigating the transition. \n🔗 https://t.co/aKPAjfVGDZ https://t.co/do17lOkxAA", "url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2115152818864529861"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-10-27T17:12:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115129428158087498"], "id": "2115129428158087498", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 29, "impression_count": 298941, "like_count": 878, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 93, "retweet_count": 125}, "text": "Are you stepping into a spacesuit this week? So are @astro_anil and @astro_kutryk — but not for Halloween!\n\nTune in here on Oct. 29 at 6:30am ET (1030 UTC) to watch these two astronauts deploy a new solar array on the @Space_Station. https://t.co/T33BGuaR8Y", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2115129428158087498"}