mark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3372, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Our Hera spacecraft can now see Didymos and Dimorphos as two separate asteroids! \n\nComing closer, it will study the effects of NASA's 2022 DART impact and help advance asteroid deflection as a planetary defence technique.\n\nThe first detailed images of Dimorphos are expected on 25 https://t.co/Fu0tYHImDt", "url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2115084984339874209"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-27T14:08:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115083281968321005"], "id": "2115083281968321005", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2677, "like_count": 45, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115074006680515007", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "if you've spent any time in a care facility, you realize that \"make the workers even more robotic\" is, in fact, very much not a solution https://t.co/SoBN6zBN5U", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2115083281968321005"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-27T14:07:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115082965902401680"], "id": "2115082965902401680", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 32, "impression_count": 17608, "like_count": 219, "quote_count": 11, "reply_count": 30, "retweet_count": 31}, "text": "this is really striking.\n\namericans aren't losing faith in just *leaders*\n\nthey're losing faith in *the people itself*\n\nthat is the real threat to the republican form of government. https://t.co/0QJbs5RkyE", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2115082965902401680"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-27T14:02:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115081626741002606"], "id": "2115081626741002606", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1866, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "21