081, "like_count": 54, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "Liftoff! A post-midnight takeoff of SpaceX's Falcon 9 rocket from Vandenberg Space Force Base. Liftoff of the Starlink 15-16 mission at 12:25 am PT (3:25 am ET / 0725 UTC).\n\nWatch live: https://t.co/Jz9aPk02wI https://t.co/TD8m0t3VpN", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114982298764583325"}, {"author_id": "34743251", "created_at": "2026-10-27T07:14:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114979142638960965"], "id": "2114979142638960965", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 531, "impression_count": 922070, "like_count": 9435, "quote_count": 117, "reply_count": 498, "retweet_count": 1171}, "text": "Watch Falcon 9 launch 27 @Starlink satellites to orbit from California https://t.co/Uxe26aH965", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2114979142638960965"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-27T07:10:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114974450047414299", "2114978044121395485"], "id": "2114978044121395485", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8203, "like_count": 33, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "SpaceX is fueling its Falcon 9 rocket at Vandenberg Space Force Base ahead of launching the Starlink 15-16 mission. Liftoff is set for 12:25 a.m. PDT (3:25 a.m. EDT / 0725 UTC).\n\nWatch live: https://t.co/Jz9aPk02wI", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114978044121395485"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-27T06:56:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114974450047414299", "2114978044121395485"], "id": "2114974450047414299", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2608, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SpaceX is fueling its Falcon 9 rocket at Vandenberg Space Force Base ahead of launching the Starlink 15-16 mission. Liftoff is set for 12:25 a.m. PDT (3:25 a.m. EDT / 0825 UTC).\n\nWatch live: https://t.co/Jz9aP